** MATERIALS
** 
*Material, name=CDM_LARC05_3D
** Activate USDFLD subroutine (computes FV1-4 from LaRC05)
*User Defined Field
** 10 SDVs: SDV1-5 = failure indices, SDV6-10 = damage variables
*Depvar
     10,
1, FI_1_Matrix,   Matrix failure index
2, FI_2_Split,    Matrix splitting failure index
3, FI_3_FibreTen, Fibre tension failure index
4, FI_4_Kink,     Fibre kinking failure index
5, FI_MAX,        Maximum local failure index
6, DMG_1,         Damage for matrix failure
7, DMG_2,         Damage for matrix splitting
8, DMG_3,         Damage for tensile fibre failure
9, DMG_4,         Damage for fibre kinking
10, DMG_COMBINED, Combined health variable
**
** Field-dependent elastic stiffness (4 field dependencies)
**   FV1 = transverse matrix damage  -> degrades E22, G12, nu12
**   FV2 = matrix mode-2 damage      -> degrades E22, G12, G23
**   FV3 = through-thickness damage   -> degrades E33, G13, G23
**   FV4 = fibre damage (combined)    -> degrades E11
** Residual stiffness = 0.001 * undamaged (avoids singularity)
